#: cb42c6f915934d51aea31fc5080a5437 of pybroker.config.StrategyConfig:11
msgid ""
":class:`pybroker.common.FeeMode` for calculating brokerage fees. Supports"
" one of:"
msgstr "用于计算经纪商手续费的 :class:`pybroker.common.FeeMode`。支持以下选项之一："

#: 07692eb83552431e89cdde1089468038 of pybroker.config.StrategyConfig:14
msgid "``ORDER_PERCENT``: Fee is a percentage of order amount."
msgstr "``ORDER_PERCENT``：手续费为订单金额的百分比。"

#: b9246b5b3e6c4685beb94058da90f22f of pybroker.config.StrategyConfig:15
msgid "``PER_ORDER``: Fee is a constant amount per order."
msgstr "``PER_ORDER``：手续费为每笔订单的固定金额。"

#: 21ae889359d4414fb820dd696dd7076e of pybroker.config.StrategyConfig:16
msgid "``PER_SHARE``: Fee is a constant amount per share in order."
msgstr "``PER_SHARE``：手续费为订单中每股的固定金额。"

#: 2696753ff16e417db9aa5cbb068cb0c5 of pybroker.config.StrategyConfig:17
msgid "``Callable[[FeeInfo], Decimal]``: Fees are calculated using a"
msgstr "``Callable[[FeeInfo], Decimal]``：手续费的计算方式为，通过一个"

#: a139331959ee4df5aa3bccad32d551f8 of pybroker.config.StrategyConfig:18
msgid "custom ``Callable`` that is passed :class:`pybroker.common.FeeInfo`."
msgstr "接收 :class:`pybroker.common.FeeInfo` 的自定义 ``Callable``。"

#: af73d9b45d844279981fd63fadb119d8 of pybroker.config.StrategyConfig:20
msgid "``None``: Fees are disabled (default)."
msgstr "``None``：禁用手续费（默认值）。"

#: f89fb3dfd3b7484ba1e696e13d06c708 of pybroker.config.StrategyConfig:22
msgid ""
"pybroker.common.FeeMode | Callable[[pybroker.common.FeeInfo], "
"decimal.Decimal] | None"
msgstr ""
"pybroker.common.FeeMode | Callable[[pybroker.common.FeeInfo], "
"decimal.Decimal] | None"

#: cf38beabf1d742069f6b864548ba5743 of pybroker.config.StrategyConfig:26
msgid "Brokerage fee amount."
msgstr "经纪商手续费金额。"

#: 3c8eb9521f324a03bad4045283f8d4c3 of pybroker.config.StrategyConfig:32
msgid ""
"Whether to enable trading fractional shares. Set to ``True`` for crypto "
"trading. Defaults to ``False``."
msgstr "是否启用碎股（fractional shares）交易。加密货币交易请设置为 ``True``。默认为 ``False``。"

#: 05bd43559c7d412085aba07ba8027d81 1c2887993660413aab36d786f3a5459b
#: 369bcc50d5c34cf9bbbdb618f46e62fb 5e543ad144ef46c8b8557662d62e1d5a
#: 92d6bc680ef047acbc6b01af6026f5c6 c07bc97849ce46c09312c826606a8681
#: ebba6b435ba642a087b23d7a7603dac6 f9e99581f3614dbc802a56809824ccb3 of
#: pybroker.config.StrategyConfig:35 pybroker.config.StrategyConfig:42
#: pybroker.config.StrategyConfig:84 pybroker.config.StrategyConfig:121
#: pybroker.config.StrategyConfig:128 pybroker.config.StrategyConfig:136
#: pybroker.config.StrategyConfig:166 pybroker.config.StrategyConfig:176
msgid "bool"
msgstr "bool"

#: 922e19176c234817b7069fb2823120c5 of pybroker.config.StrategyConfig:39
msgid "Whether to round fill prices to the nearest cent. Defaults to ``True``."
msgstr "是否将成交价格四舍五入到最接近的美分。默认为 ``True``。"

#: 1e9a5a2263924720810738f80f48d7f1 of pybroker.config.StrategyConfig:46
msgid "Position mode for :class:`pybroker.strategy.Strategy`. Supports one of:"
msgstr "用于 :class:`pybroker.strategy.Strategy` 的仓位模式。支持以下选项之一："

#: e05cf74a9158468b8e4839ad29a0e4f8 of pybroker.config.StrategyConfig:49
msgid "``DEFAULT``: Long and short positions."
msgstr "``DEFAULT``：多头和空头仓位。"

#: f3c2ecee7dc14461bcefe9c38da46982 of pybroker.config.StrategyConfig:50
msgid "``LONG_ONLY``: Long-only positions."
msgstr "``LONG_ONLY``：仅多头仓位。"

#: 6f42fb1b9555467c9e6aa20abc0e02d7 of pybroker.config.StrategyConfig:51
msgid "``SHORT_ONLY``: Short-only positions."
msgstr "``SHORT_ONLY``：仅空头仓位。"

#: 75c9b1251c9e4d40a9b1a47039c590ed of pybroker.config.StrategyConfig:53
msgid "pybroker.common.PositionMode"
msgstr "pybroker.common.PositionMode"

#: 0900bb193dc447c7ad70e82d5097c1b2 of pybroker.config.StrategyConfig:57
msgid ""
"Number of bars before placing an order for a buy signal. The default "
"value of ``1`` places a buy order on the next bar. Must be > ``0``."
msgstr "买入信号触发到下单之间等待的 K 线数量。默认值 ``1`` 表示在下一根 K 线下达买单。必须 > ``0``。"

#: 03b2b2d656cb4f638730609dd2a9c30c 062b99c9541843d29df19cbadfceb947
#: 8ec2e3ccb95249c9bb3ac5ea2a18dd53 of pybroker.config.StrategyConfig:61
#: pybroker.config.StrategyConfig:69 pybroker.config.StrategyConfig:76
msgid "int"
msgstr "int"

#: 608ee9ccd8534e82a7db1305dfcc9219 of pybroker.config.StrategyConfig:65
msgid ""
"Number of bars before placing an order for a sell signal. The default "
"value of ``1`` places a sell order on the next bar. Must be > ``0``."
msgstr "卖出信号触发到下单之间等待的 K 线数量。默认值 ``1`` 表示在下一根 K 线下达卖单。必须 > ``0``。"

#: 2191c829ac8b45ef803231658f173740 of pybroker.config.StrategyConfig:73
msgid ""
"Number of samples used to compute boostrap metrics. Defaults to "
"``10_000``."
msgstr "用于计算自助法（bootstrap）指标的样本数量。默认为 ``10_000``。"

#: 00f8d3032cfb47598a4642cea3b94b30 of pybroker.config.StrategyConfig:80
msgid ""
"Whether to automatically exit any open positions on the last bar of data "
"available for a symbol. Defaults to ``False``."
msgstr "是否在某个品种可用数据的最后一根 K 线上自动平掉所有未平仓头寸。默认为 ``False``。"

#: 49f27a10097b4d4883a939930c901096 of pybroker.config.StrategyConfig:88
msgid ""
"Fill price for covering an open short position when "
":attr:`.exit_on_last_bar` is ``True``. Defaults to "
":attr:`pybroker.common.PriceType.MIDDLE`."
msgstr ""
"当 :attr:`.exit_on_last_bar` 为 ``True`` 时，用于回补未平仓空头仓位的成交价格。默认为 "
":attr:`pybroker.common.PriceType.MIDDLE`。"

#: ca1469504c014a43afc0f39a3344027e ef5fc558cb8241ebb7656578b972353c of
#: pybroker.config.StrategyConfig:92 pybroker.config.StrategyConfig:100
msgid ""
"pybroker.common.PriceType | Callable[[str, pybroker.common.BarData], int "
"| float | decimal.Decimal]"
msgstr ""
"pybroker.common.PriceType | Callable[[str, pybroker.common.BarData], int "
"| float | decimal.Decimal]"

#: 231294ad88d94931834332aaa74e9952 of pybroker.config.StrategyConfig:96
msgid ""
"Fill price for selling an open long position when "
":attr:`.exit_on_last_bar` is ``True``. Defaults to "
":attr:`pybroker.common.PriceType.MIDDLE`."
msgstr ""
"当 :attr:`.exit_on_last_bar` 为 ``True`` 时，用于卖出未平仓多头仓位的成交价格。默认为 "
":attr:`pybroker.common.PriceType.MIDDLE`。"

#: 7415cc2bd36946abbccfc09522c96113 of pybroker.config.StrategyConfig:104
msgid ""
"Number of observations per year that will be used to annualize evaluation"
" metrics. For example, a value of ``252`` would be used to annualize the "
"Sharpe Ratio for daily returns. Also sets the accrual period for "
":attr:`.interest_rate`, and is therefore required when ``interest_rate`` "
"is set."
msgstr ""
"用于将评估指标年化的每年观测数量。例如，日线收益率使用 ``252`` 来年化夏普比率。该值还决定了 :attr:`.interest_rate`"
" 的计提周期，因此在设置 ``interest_rate`` 时必须同时设置本参数。"

#: 4b101cdd3b494ad59ce5e27e57470a7d of pybroker.config.StrategyConfig:110
msgid "int | None"
msgstr "int | None"

#: a5b0401fe7a14455b2e5a476729f71a6 of pybroker.config.StrategyConfig:114
msgid ""
"When ``True``, then bar data, indicator data, and model predictions are "
"returned with :class:`pybroker.strategy.TestResult`. Signals contain "
"base-timeframe values only; an interval-bound indicator or model appears "
"only when ``'base'`` is included in its binding. Defaults to ``False``."
msgstr ""
"为 ``True`` 时，K 线数据、指标数据和模型预测结果会随 :class:`pybroker.strategy.TestResult` "
"一并返回。信号仅包含基础时间框架的值；仅当绑定中包含 ``'base'`` 时，绑定到某个区间的指标或模型才会出现在信号中。默认为 "
"``False``。"

#: 9ccf5d5407cf4888b1cd65b89f523e19 of pybroker.config.StrategyConfig:125
msgid ""
"When ``True``, then stop values are returned with "
":class:`pybroker.strategy.TestResult`. Defaults to ``False``."
msgstr ""
"为 ``True`` 时，止损值会随 :class:`pybroker.strategy.TestResult` 一并返回。默认为 "
"``False``。"

#: 42e87993d0914ccab4bf5c6970eb65b3 of pybroker.config.StrategyConfig:132
msgid ""
"When ``True``, round values in :class:`pybroker.strategy.TestResult` up "
"to the nearest cent. Defaults to ``True``."
msgstr ""
"为 ``True`` 时，:class:`pybroker.strategy.TestResult` 中的数值会被四舍五入到最接近的美分。默认为 "
"``True``。"

#: ab09d696a0c54c40a5a1eb1c4e721328 of pybroker.config.StrategyConfig:140
msgid ""
"Account leverage multiplier for buying power on long and short positions."
" Default ``1.0`` uses cash-only buying. ``2.0`` allows positions up to 2x"
" equity. Must be ``>= 1.0``."
msgstr ""
"多头和空头仓位购买力所使用的账户杠杆倍数。默认值 ``1.0`` 表示仅使用现金买入。 ``2.0`` 允许持有最多 2 倍权益的仓位。必须 "
"``>= 1.0``。"

#: 182a8f0dd65d4127ad98262b8c836b47 of pybroker.config.StrategyConfig:148
msgid ""
"Annual interest rate, in percent, applied to net cash balance (``cash - "
"margin_loan``). Charges interest when net cash is negative and credits "
"interest when net cash is positive. Accrues once per bar at "
"``interest_rate / bars_per_year``, so :attr:`.bars_per_year` is required "
"when this is set. Defaults to ``0`` (disabled)."
msgstr ""
"以百分比表示的年利率，作用于净现金余额（``cash - margin_loan``）。净现金为负时收取利息，为正时计入利息收益。按每根 K 线 "
"``interest_rate / bars_per_year`` 的比例计提一次，因此设置本参数时必须同时设置 "
":attr:`.bars_per_year`。默认为 ``0`` （禁用）。"

#: 0e4918710af341da968c8e45841bc8bc of pybroker.config.StrategyConfig:159
msgid ""
"When ``True``, append full :class:`pybroker.portfolio.PortfolioBar` "
"snapshots to :attr:`pybroker.portfolio.Portfolio.bars` on every bar. When"
" ``False`` (default), per-bar metrics are stored in a compact buffer used"
" for :class:`pybroker.strategy.TestResult` and "
":class:`pybroker.eval.EvalMetrics`."
msgstr ""
"为 ``True`` 时，会在每根 K 线将完整的 :class:`pybroker.portfolio.PortfolioBar` 快照追加到 "
":attr:`pybroker.portfolio.Portfolio.bars`。为 ``False`` （默认）时，逐 K "
"线指标会存储在一个紧凑缓冲区中，供 :class:`pybroker.strategy.TestResult` 和 "
":class:`pybroker.eval.EvalMetrics` 使用。"

#: ec227c2d0a174a519f0c9ddbe8a4b805 of pybroker.config.StrategyConfig:170
msgid ""
"When ``True``, append full :class:`pybroker.portfolio.PositionBar` "
"snapshots to :attr:`pybroker.portfolio.Portfolio.position_bars` on every "
"bar. When ``False`` (default), "
":attr:`pybroker.strategy.TestResult.positions` is empty."
msgstr ""
"为 ``True`` 时，会在每根 K 线将完整的 :class:`pybroker.portfolio.PositionBar` 快照追加到 "
":attr:`pybroker.portfolio.Portfolio.position_bars`。为 ``False`` "
"（默认）时，:attr:`pybroker.strategy.TestResult.positions` 为空。"

